# International > Number Format (dialog 17): a blank 1000 separator, 3 decimal digits, no leading
# zero, OK, then OK in International (tab from Change... to OK) - WIN.INI [intl] is written, the
# blank as " ". Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/intl-number.scn after opening. Run as intl.w16
# (ARCH311_PRISTINE_INI=1, ARCH311_CLOCK="2026-10-08 09:30:24", applet International).
sleep 900
shot shots/01-open.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key enter
